+### Changed
+- Refreshed the Zarr links dialog: every layer URL is shown in full with its own Copy button, the whole-dataset link is offered as "All layers" (WEBKNOSSOS only), and links are grouped in a collapsible list. Sharing, Zarr links and version restore are now disabled with an explanation when not logged in.
